{
  "_doc": "Generic effect vocabulary (no xLights names; see adapters/xlights/effect_map.json). music_fit = IDEAL feature levels 0..1; model_fit keyed by models.json geometry_class; geometry_requirements are soft; hard_min entries are gates; layers lists which passes may use the effect. drums (level of the drum stem) and melody (how much of the window has a clear tune) are measured only with stems ('run --stems'); without them they are left out of the fit. A parameter with choices picks one by the seed; by_class narrows the choices for a prop shape (geometry_class), e.g. meteors explode on spinners and rings (0.24.25). 'render' (0.24.36): on a group xLights draws as one picture, how good the effect looks that way ('group', with the group's shape) and on each of its props ('per_model', with the props' shapes) - 1.0 each when not given; the better one is used (a group's 'render' preference or a pin's render= decides instead).",
